{"pin":"AB00700","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00700","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou pilgrim who art laden with the perfume of musk! Hafiz of Shíraz stateth in his Divan that the Parsi-speaking Turks impart life.... ...The friends of God must live in accord with the exhortations and admonitions of the Light of reality, the Blessed Perfection","first_line_orig":"ای زائر مشکین نفس حافظ شیرازی در دیوان خویش میگوید ترکان پارسی گو بخشندگان  ","language":"Per","word_count":"470","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT2.154","source":"ASAT2","locator":"154","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/428.pdf#page=79"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0868","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0868","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/203106378"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT2.278","source":"MKT2","locator":"278","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA2/ma2-278.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MSHR2.343x","source":"MSHR2","locator":"343x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/o/MASH2/mash2-345.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YHA1.133x","source":"YHA1","locator":"133x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/686.pdf#page=135"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YHA1.378x","source":"YHA1","locator":"378x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/686.pdf#page=380"},{"kind":"translation","code":"DAS.1913-12-28x","source":"DAS","locator":"1913-12-28x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/s/sohrab_diary_letters_1913-1914_06.pdf#page=99"}]},{"code":"AB00700EXH","anchor":"exh","translations":[{"language":"sw","lang_name":"Swahili"}]}]}
